OL,3,GNEWSAYouth charity forced to end
OL,4,A'life-changing' course
OL,5,
OL,6,FA basic skills programme described as
OL,7,F"life-changing" for young people is to
OL,8,Fclose after losing its funding.
OL,10,FYoung Devon, a charity working in
OL,11,FExeter, Newton Abbot, Paignton and
OL,12,FPlymouth, has been running the courses
OL,13,Ffor students who leave schools without
OL,14,Fqualifications for a decade.
OL,16,FBut the charity, which still has more
OL,17,Fthan 100 young people on its waiting
OL,18,Flist, is set to lose its #400,000
OL,19,Ffunding from September.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
