OL,3,GNEWSAYouth charity forced to end
OL,4,A'life-changing' course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe programme, aimed at young people
OL,7,Fwho are not in education, employment or
OL,8,Ftraining (Neets), came from Weston
OL,9,FCollege in Somerset as part of its
OL,10,Foutreach work. A spokesperson said the
OL,11,Fchange followed "a strategic review of
OL,12,Flearner demand and funding priorities".
